{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"ja","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-21021","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21021-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21021-0","text":"豊穣の運命専用の光円錐、光円錐のスキルはこの運命にのみ有効。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21021-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21021-1","text":"龍女の雷勁按摩を堪能した後、\n狐族の少女は手を伸ばし、彼女の頬をつねった。\nちっちゃな龍女の口をとがらせた顔を見て、彼女は艶やかに微笑んだ。\n\n「等価交換ですよ」","speaker":""}]}
